MyGo patch 0006 (Auralink): prereleases, a beta channel of GitHub
releases.

Apps whose updates are GitHub releases only ever see the latest release
(releases/latest/download/, or with a tag prefix the newest release that
is neither a draft nor a prerelease). An app with a beta channel needs
its users who opt in to get prereleases (1.3.0-beta.1), and the others
not to.

- mygo.Updater.SetPrereleases(on) / Prereleases(): with it on, Check
  lists the releases through the GitHub API (update.ResolvePrereleaseFeed,
  for the latest release's feed and for tagged feeds) and offers the
  highest version that is not a draft, a release or a prerelease, when it
  is newer than the running one. One API request a check; when the API
  fails (GitHub allows 60 an hour for each address, said in plain words
  when it is the limit), Check falls back to the latest release and
  returns the API's error when that is no update. Updates never go back.
- mygo.ErrNotPublished: Check's error wraps it when the feed has no
  release yet (the latest release's 404 while only prereleases are
  published, or no tagged release), and the updater plugin shows "up to
  date" for it instead of an error.
- updates.prereleases (mygo.json, mygo.config.ts): -upload creates the
  draft of a version with a pre-release part with --prerelease, and
  builds make delta updates from the newest version of both channels (the
  latest release and the newest prerelease, each channel's first, then
  the versions their manifests list), so that beta users get a delta of
  the next beta or release too. Before, builds read the latest release's
  manifest only: no delta from one beta to the next, nor to the release.
- docs/updates.md "Prereleases", docs/configuration.md.

Tests: TestUpdaterPrereleases (channels, no downgrade, the highest
version over the newest release, the API's limit and its fallback,
nothing published), TestResolvePrereleaseFeed, TestWriteDeltasPrereleases
(betas before the first release, a release after betas, a beta after a
release), TestPublishGitHub, TestNotPublished (plugin).
